# Data Handling

The application processes various types of data sources for analysis.

## Data Directories

Data is organized in specific directories:

- [src/report_generation/data/](mdc:src/report_generation/data/): Main data directory
  - [src/report_generation/data/Health_history/](mdc:src/report_generation/data/Health_history/): Health history visualizations
  - [src/report_generation/data/Health_live/](mdc:src/report_generation/data/Health_live/): Health live visualizations
  - [src/report_generation/data/Youtube_history/](mdc:src/report_generation/data/Youtube_history/): YouTube history visualizations
  - [src/report_generation/data/Youtube_live/](mdc:src/report_generation/data/Youtube_live/): YouTube live JSON data

## Output Directories

Generated reports are saved to:

- [src/report_generation/reports/](mdc:src/report_generation/reports/): Final reports
- [src/report_generation/reports/temp/](mdc:src/report_generation/reports/temp/): Temporary files during processing

## Data Processing

The application handles several data formats:

1. Images (PNG, JPG): Analyzed using vision-capable LLMs
2. JSON data: Parsed and analyzed by specialized crews
3. HTML files: Referenced for additional context
